config SORABBYNGOFS
    tristate "SorabbyngoFS — AI-native filesystem"
    depends on BLOCK
    help
      AI-native VFS filesystem for Sorabbyngo OS.
      Provides Zone 3 (AI sandbox) with ByngoPress compression,
      self-healing journaling, and consent-gated cross-zone access.

      Say M to build as a loadable kernel module (recommended).
      Say Y to build into the kernel directly.

config SORABBYNGOFS_ENFORCE_CONSENT
    bool "Enforce Ed25519 consent signature verification"
    depends on SORABBYNGOFS
    default n
    help
      When enabled, every AI cross-zone file operation must carry
      a valid Ed25519 signature issued by the CML subsystem.

      Disable during development. MUST be enabled in production builds.

config SORABBYNGOFS_COMPRESS
    bool "Enable ByngoPress compression in AI zone"
    depends on SORABBYNGOFS
    default y
    help
      Enables 10000:1 semantic compression for files in /ai-workspace.
      Requires sorabbyngo-os/byngo-press to be built and linked.
